== Effect ==
* Grants [[spectral tears]] that travel through [[obstacles]] (but not enemies) instead of breaking on impact with them.
* {{dlc|r}} +0.5 [[tears]].

== Synergies ==
* {{i|The Parasite}}: When tears pass through solid objects, they will split, resulting in many tears shooting out from every rock the original tear passed through.

== Interactions ==
* {{c|Azazel}}/{{i|Brimstone}}/{{c|Tainted Azazel}}: The beam becomes translucent, but [[spectral]] has no effect.
* {{i|Dr. Fetus}}: Bombs will become translucent and pass through objects.
* {{i|Epic Fetus}}: Spectral has no effect.
* {{C|The Forgotten}}: Spectral provides no benefit for both characters, as the bone club can hit through obstacles and {{C|The Soul}} has spectral tears passively.{{dlc-}}
** The exception is with any synergy on The Forgotten that creates normal tears.
* {{C|The Lost|a}}: Spectral provides no benefit, as The Lost starts with spectral tears by default.
* {{i|Mom's Knife}}: The knife becomes translucent, but [[spectral]] has no effect.
* {{i|Technology}}/{{i|Technology 2}}: Allows the laser to go through objects.

